  "description": "The “Venice” beach cruiser, is a steel framed bicycle designed to deliver the most comfortable cruise. A step up from our iconic “Isla Vista” this bicycle features the patented tripod frame that places the rider in a relaxed foot forward pedaling position. Other quality features are upgraded double density rubber ergonomic design grips, a saddle with elastomer springs that provide extra cushion, our triple tread “Sticky-G” slick beach cruiser tires for smooth rolling and stainless steel spokes for extra durability. The “Venice” is a solid cruiser that is sure to become a trustworthy companion on all your adventures. With a wide color selection you can perfectly match your car, clothing or mood!",
